    {
      "id": "note-plan-graph",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -600,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# Layered Plan Graph\n\nRows are the authoritative LT → MT → ST → WP decomposition levels. Solid arrows decompose; labeled dashed arrows are typed cross-cutting relationships. Open a linked node for decisions and evidence; use `structure/graph.json` for programmatic traversal."
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-LT-001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -210,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## [[_plan/long-term/LT-001.md|LT-001 · Make automated routing accountable]]\n\n**Level:** `long-term` · **Status:** `ready`\n**Updated:** 2026-09-15\n\nOperators can inspect and explain automated routing behavior."
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-MT-001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -210,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## [[_plan/mid-term/MT-001.md|MT-001 · Provide reproducible routing traces]]\n\n**Level:** `mid-term` · **Status:** `ready`\n**Updated:** 2026-09-15\n\nRepresent each routing choice as a reproducible trace."
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-ST-001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -210,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## [[_plan/short-term/ST-001.md|ST-001 · Introduce and verify a trace schema]]\n\n**Level:** `short-term` · **Status:** `ready`\n**Updated:** 2026-09-15\n\nDeliver a trace schema and a reader that verifies replayability."
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-WP-001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## [[_plan/work-package/WP-001.md|WP-001 · Define the routing trace schema]]\n\n**Level:** `work-package` · **Status:** `ready`\n**Updated:** 2026-09-15\n\nDefine the minimum trace needed to reproduce a routing decision.\n\n**Qualities:** quietly legible under operational pressure"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-WP-002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[_plan/work-package/WP-002.md|WP-002 · Verify trace replay]]\n\n**Level:** `work-package` · **Status:** `proposed`\n**Updated:** 2026-09-15\n\nVerify that a trace reader reproduces the recorded routing choice."
    }
  ],
